is, the transfer of an N-acetyl-D-galactosamine residue to a serine or threonine residue on the protein receptor."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}